/*node 2:Choosing a male motorist given that the motorist buys V-Power*/
mistake_2:decimalplaces(male_v/super_fuel,2);

/*node 3:Choosing a male motorist given that the motorist buys diesel.*/
mistake_3:decimalplaces(male_diesel/super_fuel,2);

/*node 1:checks correct answers*/

/*node 2:Computing the probability that a motorist has his or her car not serviced by the garage*/
mistake_2:decimalplaces(1-car_serviced,2);

